{"id":"word:hebrew:H1361","type":"word","title":"גָּבַהּ","subtitle":"H1361 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"to soar , i.e. be lofty ; figuratively, to be haughty","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to גָּבַהּ (H1361) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: v.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 34 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"גָּבַהּ (gâbahh) means to soar , i.e. be lofty ; figuratively, to be haughty First listed occurrence: 1Sam 10 23."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"גָּבַהּ","transliteration":"gâbahh","pronunciation":"gaw-bah'","strong":"H1361","lemmaId":"hebrew:H1361","partOfSpeech":"v","forms":["גָּבַ֤הּ","וַ/יִּגְבַּ֥הּ","וַ/יִּגְבַּהּ֙","גָבַ֖הּ","וַ/יַּגְבִּיהֶ֖/הָ"],"morphs":[["HVqp3ms",5],["HC/Vqw3ms",4],["HVqp3cp",4],["HVha",2],["HVhi2ms",2],["HR/Vqc",2],["HC/Vhw3ms/Sp3fs",1],["HC/Vqw3fp",1],["HVhp1cs",1],["HC/Vqw3fs",1]]},"definitions":{"short":"to soar , i.e. be lofty ; figuratively, to be haughty","usage":"exalt, be haughty, be (make) high(-er), lift up, mount up, be proud, raise up great height, upward.","full":"H1361. gabahh גָּבַהּ verb be high, exalted (Late Hebrew id. (Hiph`il), Aramaic גְּבַהּ , compare Arabic forehead , prominence of forehead ; compare perhaps also Assyrian gabâni , heights (?) Lotz TP 133 ) — Qal Perfect ׳ג 2Chr 26:16 5 t.; גָָּֽבְהָא֯ Ezek 31:5 ( א = ה ); גָּבַהְתָּ 31:10 , גָּבְהוּ Job 35:5 3 t.; Imperfect יִגְבַּהּ Prov 18:12 5 t.; suffix יִגְבְּהוּ Ezek 31:14 , יִגְבָּ֑הוּ Job 36:7 , תִּגְבָּ֑הוּ Jer 13:15 , תִּגְבְּהֶינָה Ezek 16:50 ; Infinitive כִּגְבֹהַּ Psa 103:11 , לְגָבְהָה Zeph 3:11 ; &#8212; 1 be high, lofty, tall , e.g. tree Ezek 19:11 ; 31:5 , 10 , 14 , heavens Job 35:5 ; Isa 55:9 ; Psa 103:11 , man 1Sam 10:23 . 2 be exalted , of man in dignity and honour Job 36:7 , of servant of Yahweh Isa 52:13 , God 5:16 , God's ways 55:9 . 3 lofty לִבּוֺ גָּבַהּ : — a. in a good sense , encouraged in the ways of Yahweh 2Chr 17:6 ; b. elsewhere in a bad sense , be haughty Psa 131:1 ; Prov 18:12 ; 2Chr 26:16 ; 32:25 ; Ezek 28:2 , 5 , 17 , and so without לב Isa 3:16 ; Jer 13:15 ; Ezek 16:50 ; Zeph 3:11 . Hiph`il Perfect הִגְבַּהְתִּי Ezek 17:24 ; Imperfect יַגְבִּיהַּ Job 39:27 ; Jer 49:16 ; Obadiah 4; וַיַּגְבִּיהֶהָ 2Chr 33:14 ; יַגְבִּיהוּ Job 5:7 ; Infinitive הַגְבֵּהַּ Isa 7:11 ; Ezek 21:31 ; Participle מַגְבִּיהַּ Prov 17:19 ; Psa 113:5 ; &#8212; make high, exalt , e.g. trees Ezek 17:24 , wall 2Chr 33:14 , gate Prov 17:19 , nest Jer 49:16 ; Obadiah 4, dwelling Psa 103:5 , a request Isa 7:11 , the lowly Ezek 21:31 ; עוּף יַגְבִּיהוּ make their flight high, soar aloft Job 5:7 , without עוף 39:27 .","rootNote":"a primitive root;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Sam 10 23","keyReferences":["1Sam 10 23","2Chr 17 6","2Chr 26 16","2Chr 32 25","2Chr 33 14","Ezek 16 50","Ezek 17 24","Ezek 19 11"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":34,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Sam 10 23","book":"1Sam","chapter":10,"verse":23,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וַ/יִּגְבַּהּ֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Vqw3ms"},{"reference":"2Chr 17 6","book":"2Chr","chapter":17,"verse":6,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וַ/יִּגְבַּ֥הּ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Vqw3ms"},{"reference":"2Chr 26 16","book":"2Chr","chapter":26,"verse":16,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"גָּבַ֤הּ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVqp3ms"},{"reference":"2Chr 32 25","book":"2Chr","chapter":32,"verse":25,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"גָבַ֖הּ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVqp3ms"},{"reference":"2Chr 33 14","book":"2Chr","chapter":33,"verse":14,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וַ/יַּגְבִּיהֶ֖/הָ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Vhw3ms/Sp3fs"},{"reference":"Ezek 16 50","book":"Ezek","chapter":16,"verse":50,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וַֽ/תִּגְבְּהֶ֔ינָה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Vqw3fp"},{"reference":"Ezek 17 24","book":"Ez